          "lines": [
            280,
            296
          ]
        }
      ],
      "recommended_action": "Borrow receipt in read-only accessors or destructure it once, and compare error variants by matches or provide suitable traits. Run the actual test target after a separately authorized repair.",
      "validation": "Entire lib.rs read plus rg of GateError/GateReceipt definitions and impls in scoped src; no native or Cargo execution."
    },
