      "finding": "arity_sum casts each usize arity to i64 and sums without checks. On64-bit hosts NewForm(2^63) has negative secondary cost; two valid large i64 arities can overflow their sum. Bounds::validate imposes no arity ceiling. This breaks the declared nonnegative arity refinement on public Item inputs even before search allocates contexts.",
