          "lines": [
            163,
            185
          ]
        }
      ],
      "recommended_action": "Carry supply provenance in the replay state or provide an explicit replay-session type; do not apply the main replay composition law to BRegime alone.",
      "validation": "ROUT-CHECK011 independent exact two-event control."
    },
