      "id": "ROUT-F011",
      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "Tree continuation can reuse an admitted token and form a self-loop",
      "finding": "Custom valid reading with two marks including token g2 reaches no collapsed pairs; continuation emits g2 because n_data=2. Admission designates the existing datum, canonical key stays identical, and attach merges to the parent. Fixed fixtures avoid this collision, but public build_tree does not enforce it.",
